      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i get the caution thing but is there like an actual risk of something serious happening? like am i gonna have a seizure or something if i take a standard dose? if it's just like feeling a bit nauseous or dizzy i think i can handle that just to get some sleep. please just be straight with me, is it actually life-threatening or is it just a precaution?",
